WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:07.450
(Tell the story)

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.910
Salí del barrio
(I left the neighborhood)

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.040
Con las manos vacías
(With empty hands)

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.180
Buscando el peso
(Looking for the peso)

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.480
Todos los días
(Every day)

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.320
Mi madre dijo
(My mother said)

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.360
Ten mucho cuidado
(Be very careful)

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.940
El mundo es frío
(The world is cold)

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.020
Y complicado

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.650
Pero yo tengo
(But I have)

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.780
Mucha ambición
(A lot of ambition)

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.210
Brindo por los míos
(I toast to mine Cheers to us)

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.820
Por la familia
(In God we trust)

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.560
Dinero en la mesa
(Money on the table)

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.020
Y buena comida
(And good food)

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:14.890
No olvido mis raíces
(I don't forget my roots Where I'm from)

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:33.720
Ni de donde vengo
(Nor where I come from Play that guitar Keep it going)

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.930
Manejo un carro
(I drive a car)

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.500
Por la carretera
(Down the highway)

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.330
Vidrios oscuros
(Dark windows)

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.800
A mi manera
(My own way)

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.530
Tengo amigos
(I have friends)

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:57.240
Falsos y reales
(Fake and real)

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:00.860
Yo sé quiénes son
(I know who they are)

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.380
Los más leales
(The most loyal)

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.970
Porque yo tengo
(Because I have)

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.520
Un buen corazón
(A good heart)

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:16.920
Brindo por los míos
(I toast to mine Cheers to us)

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.590
Por la familia
(In God we trust)

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:24.410
Dinero en la mesa
(Money on the table)

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.760
Y buena comida
(And good food)

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:46.990
El cielo es el límite
(The sky is the limit Look up high)

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:51.350
No voy a parar
(Watch me fly)

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.220
Salud
(Cheers)

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.600
Para siempre
(Forever)
